---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { studio } from '../config/studio';
---
<Base title="Privacy" description="How Shaili Design Studio uses enquiry details.">
  <section class="wrap section max-w-3xl">
    <h1 class="h-lg">Privacy</h1>
    <div class="mt-8 space-y-5 lead">
      <p>This page explains, in plain language, how {studio.name} uses information you send through the enquiry form. The studio owner should review and edit it before launch.</p>
      <p>We collect the details you enter, such as your name, email, city and project description, only to read your enquiry and reply to you. Form submissions are received and stored by our hosting provider, Netlify, and forwarded to the studio by email.</p>
      <p>We do not use enquiry details for unrelated purposes. To ask about or remove your details, contact the studio using the details on the <a class="underline" href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
